&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;Stackline is the first full-funnel connected commerce platform for the world&#39;s most innovative brands. Business leaders, product innovators, performance marketers, and analysts trust Stackline as the single source of commerce truth. Fueled by our proprietary neural network, our market insights, revenue metrics, behavior analyses, and autonomous functionality create the actions that determine success or failure.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Founded in 2014 in Seattle, we now have offices in Minneapolis, New York, Cleveland, and London. Since November 2020, Stackline has raised $180 million in strategic investments from Goldman Sachs Growth Equity and TA Associates.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Stackline is on a mission to fuel the future of commerce by bringing brands and customers closer together.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About The Role:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the Retail Operations Team, as a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Senior Manager, Brand Operations&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;where you will serve as the vital link between brand strategy and operational excellence. You will be responsible for managing the day-to-day and back-end mechanics that allow the world’s most innovative brands to thrive across multiple commerce channels. Utilize Stackline’s proprietary data set to uncover opportunities as a trusted advisor to some of the biggest brands in the world. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager, Brand Operations will be responsible for operating clients’ supply chains, enabling multi-channel fulfilment while driving profitability. You will own the results of brands’ performances and be the subject matter expert for packaging, fulfillment and supply chain optimization. You will be expected to be the subject matter expert and incorporate new supply chain and fulfillment technologies that optimize brands’ performances across retailers. This individual will innovate and be part of creating the tools and systems that will help brands successfully operate their businesses. &lt;strong&gt;This is a hybrid role based in London, UK (4 days/week in office).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Catalog Management – &lt;/strong&gt;create, maintain and optimize product listings to ensure accuracy, compliance and discoverability across all retail platforms.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Forecasting – &lt;/strong&gt;analyze historical data and market trends while leveraging proprietary Stackline tools to create accurate demand forecasts, ensuring optimal inventory levels.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Order Management – &lt;/strong&gt;Oversee the end-to-end order generations, ensuring timely processing and coordination between brands, retailers and carriers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Channel Fulfillment – &lt;/strong&gt;manage and scale fulfillment strategies across various platforms to maximize logistical efficiencies and minimize cost.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promotional Planning – &lt;/strong&gt;partner with marketing teams to align operational readiness with promotional calendars, peak planning and new product launches.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Defect Resolution – &lt;/strong&gt;proactively monitor and identify operations defects, including shipping errors, listing suppressions and supply chain disruptions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who We Are Looking For:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant supply chain and/or account management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years running and operation e-commerce retail fulfilment for programs such as Amazon Seller Central&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience using Microsoft Excel to analyze large amounts of data and draw insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience drawing insights from data to provide recommendations to clients on e-commerce strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to stay organized while prioritizing and managing workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of synthesizing various data inputs into cohesive, creative, and polished client deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated excellent written and oral communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Bonus Points If You Have:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience manipulating data with technologies such as Redshift, SQL, Python, or similar.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools to develop new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits and Perks:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s important that each and every employee feels they are supported and can complete their life’s best work today and in the future. As part of that, we are committed to doing our part in addressing pay gaps and discrepancies by providing pay transparency for all of our roles. Actual salaries are just one component of the compensation package and may vary above or below the range based on job-related knowledge, skills, experience, geographical location, and performance. The pay range for this position located in London is £70,000 - £85,000 per year. Other rewards may include annual bonuses, short- and long-term incentives, and other team-specific awards. In addition, we provide a robust benefits and perks package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Stackline is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We encourage applicants from all backgrounds to apply. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP&#39;s content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today&#39;s always on, AI driven marketing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://wpp.com/__;!!JboVxjCXSME!N9KGoZIn5nCC-uOWhEdE-ChrrJuf6TgkLzNNkLaW9BExJsVqZZ_hMSmGbARJ0tdBOnKYM7kEbv5L3ncUpg7-6uEPNdY$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;6ded86b6-cde3-4e48-958d-34727f881edd&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does a AI Producer do at WPP Production?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an AI Producer to support the delivery of innovative, technology-enabled content and campaigns across multiple channels and formats. This role is ideal for a producer with agency or production-house experience who is curious about emerging AI workflows and excited to help shape the future of creative production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Producer will manage projects end-to-end while collaborating with creative, strategy, production, motion, CGI, OOH, and technology teams to deliver high-quality work on time and on budget. The role requires a strong understanding of integrated production workflows, emerging AI tools, and the operational and legal considerations involved in modern content creation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will be highly organised, solutions-oriented, eager to learn, and passionate about production, technology, and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Areas of Responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key day-to-day contact for clients, agency partners, and internal stakeholders across projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support communication between creative, production, AI, CGI, motion, and post-production teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure project timelines, deliverables, and priorities are clearly communicated to all stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain awareness of client satisfaction and proactively escalate risks or concerns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help guide conversations around AI-enabled workflows and production efficiencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with interdisciplinary teams including creatives, strategists, technologists, editors, motion designers, CGI artists, and external vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster strong working relationships across local and global production teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and mentor junior team members where appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a positive, collaborative, and solutions-focused production culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage medium- to large-scale integrated production projects from briefing through delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support productions across AI-led content creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate schedules, budgets, approvals, assets, deliverables, and production workflows across multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evaluate and implement AI tools and workflows within production pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear documentation including timelines, trackers, meeting notes, status reports, and risk management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure projects are delivered on brief, on brand, on time, and on budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with project scoping, budgeting, estimates, and reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track project costs, vendor management, POs, billing, and financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with production, finance, and operations teams to ensure commercial accuracy and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cost-effective production solutions while maintaining creative quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legal &amp;amp; Compliance Awareness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a basic understanding of legal, compliance, and usage considerations related to AI-generated content and production workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support adherence to licensing, talent usage, rights management, and content governance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure production processes align with client, platform, and company compliance standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate legal or compliance concerns to relevant teams when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-Day Responsibilities May Include&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and maintaining project scopes, timelines, and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating with WPP Production’s global production network to support integrated campaign launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing day-to-day communication with clients, agencies, suppliers, and internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting productions involving AI-generated content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising with vendors and partners to obtain briefs, schedules, assets, and technical specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing trackers, reporting documents, and workflow systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting with production operations, resourcing, and traffic coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting safe innovation and experimentation with new production technologies and AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5+ years of production experience within an integrated agency, creative agency, production company, or studio environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across integrated content production including OOH, CGI, motion, film, digital, and social content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of AI tools, AI-assisted creative workflows, and emerging production technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of production and post-production processes from brief through final delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of asset management, formats, usage rights, and content delivery specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of legal and compliance considerations related to production and AI-generated content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects and stakeholders in fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, organisation, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to deliver projects on time and within budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural problem solver and passion for innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At WPP Production, you’ll help shape the future of content production at a truly global scale. We bring together world-class talent, cutting-edge studios, and advanced technology to solve some of the most complex creative and production challenges in the industry. You’ll work in a collaborative, borderless environment where craft excellence is valued, innovation is encouraged, and AI and next-generation tools are used to amplify not replace human creativity. With access to diverse projects, global career opportunities, and the backing of WPP’s unmatched network, this is a place where you can grow your skills, make real impact, and create work that performs for every audience, across every channel, at every moment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion and Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on legitimate interest as a legal basis for processing personal information under the GDPR for purposes of recruitment and applications for employment. When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button at the bottom of this page, this will send all the information you have added to WPP Production. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our Privacy&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarthww.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;st&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarth.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;atement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please contact &lt;a ----- ----- if you need the job advert or form in another format.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Affirm, we exist for the moments that matter—giving people a clear, predictable way to pay over time, with no hidden fees, no surprises, and no tradeoffs on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Engineering team &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Engineering team builds systems that power Affirm’s mission. We take pride in our craft, building reliable, performant, and scalable solutions that touch every part of the business. Whether we’re enabling new ways to pay, ensuring our platforms can scale to the most demanding levels in the industry, or developing seamless servicing experiences, our focus is on solving complex problems through exceptional engineering.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Affirm’s Identity team is mission-critical to the customer checkout experience. When a customer chooses Affirm, one of the first steps is an identity check, and our ability to make the right decision directly impacts conversion, revenue, fraud exposure, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team owns Identity for all markets outside North America, playing a key role in Affirm’s international expansion. We are responsible for KYC, user lifecycle management, and identity decisioning across multiple regulatory environments. As an Engineering Manager on our team, you’ll help shape how Affirm adapts its core Identity platform to new market dynamics, customer expectations, and compliance requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead and grow a well-balanced team of engineers – setting clear expectations, giving direct feedback, and developing each engineer toward their next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the team’s technical strategy and multi-quarter roadmap, tying it to major experience initiatives that build customer trust and move Affirm’s business, including large-scale redesigns and structural improvements to the identity verification journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will empower your tech lead and engineers to hold the design and quality bar, supporting them hands-on throughout technical design and cross-functional alignment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the availability, reliability, and performance of consumer-critical systems – on-call, incident response, and reducing operational toil.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will drive alignment across multiple organizations and influence roadmaps on partner experience and foundational teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner across Product, Design, and Analytics, and other Engineering teams, building trust and taking part in cross-functional efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have 7+ years of software engineering experience, including 3+ years managing and growing engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have proven experience delivering consumer-facing software and driving execution through ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have the technical judgment required to guide architecture, quality, and reliability decisions, with the instinct to empower senior engineers to make the calls rather than making them all yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have experience leading significant technical initiatives end-to-end, ideally decoupling or re-platforming consumer-facing systems within clear time constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have a calm, decisive presence through change and ambiguity – building alignment, resolving tensions, and leading others through complex decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a humble, team-first leader who builds a high-trust, psychologically safe culture, while also prioritizing your own growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to balance customer needs, business goals, and technical constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You exhibit exceptional communication, stakeholder management, and organizational influence skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have a proven ability to build alignment and drive outcomes in complex environments without direct authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires either equivalent practical experience or a Bachelor’s degree in a related field.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base Pay Grade - P&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equity Grade - 7&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employees new to Affirm typically come in at the start of the pay range. Affirm focuses on providing a simple and transparent pay structure which is based on a variety of factors, including location, experience and job-related skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay is part of a total compensation package that may include equity rewards, monthly stipends for health, wellness and tech spending, and benefits (including 100% subsidised medical coverage, dental and vision for you and your dependents.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay range per year: &lt;strong&gt;£142,000 - £190,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: UK Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-first with flexibility built in&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Affirm is proud to be a remote-first company. Most roles can be done from almost anywhere within the country of employment. Some positions may occasionally require in-person work at an Affirm office, and a few are office-based due to the nature of the work. All new hires will be invited to attend an in-person onboarding experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits designed for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our benefits reflect our commitment to care, transparency, and flexibility. Here are a few highlights:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage at no cost: We cover 100% of premiums for employees and their dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spending stipends: Monthly stipends support your tech setup, and the ability to choose health and wellness options that are right for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge: Flexible time off and generous holiday calendars help you rest when you need to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a piece of what you build: Our employee stock purchase plan (ESPP) lets you buy Affirm stock at a discount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to providing an inclusive interview process, including accommodations for candidates with disabilities. If you need support, we’re happy to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For positions based in San Francisco or Los Angeles: Affirm considers qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records, as required by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By clicking &quot;Submit Application,&quot; you acknowledge that you have read Affirm&#39;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.affirm.com/global-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; and consent to the use of your personal information as described.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Senior Consultant with experience in Commerce ecosystems and technologies wanted to join our Business Services team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How consumers discover, evaluate and buy products is changing faster than most organisations can respond. AI-powered search, agentic commerce, generative product discovery and the collapse of the traditional funnel are reshaping commercial models across every sector. Most enterprise clients know something has shifted, few have a clear plan for what to do about it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is building a commerce consulting practice to help clients navigate these shifts. We work with some of the world&#39;s most recognised brands, translating complex commercial challenges into actionable strategies, transformation roadmaps and delivery programmes. What makes this role different from a boutique or a SaaS provider is what sits around you: your consulting recommendations connect directly to creative, content, CX and commerce execution teams who bring them to life. Strategy doesn&#39;t end at a slide deck here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Consultant who can own projects and client relationships. Someone who takes an ambiguous brief, structures it independently, drives the strategic direction and ensures the quality of everything the team delivers. You&#39;ll lead client conversations, design and facilitate workshops, and be the person mid-to-senior client stakeholders trust to connect diagnostic findings to commercial action. You&#39;ll also play a key role in growing the practice, spotting extension opportunities within accounts, contributing to pitches and coaching more junior members of the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perm&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London/Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel to client site where required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Leadership &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own medium-scale projects end-to-end: scope, quality, delivery timeline, and client relationship. Accountable for the strategic direction and the standard of output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of strategic recommendations across commerce transformation, AI discoverability (GEO/AEO), agentic commerce readiness, content strategy and channel optimisation - shaping the narrative, not just building the analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ambiguous or loosely defined briefs and structure them into clear project plans with defined deliverables, milestones and resource requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and codify delivery methodologies into repeatable, scalable frameworks the wider team can execute against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and lead workshops, stakeholder interviews and co-creation sessions. You will be comfortable going off-script when the conversation requires it and steering senior client stakeholders toward actionable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to mid-to-senior client contacts. You are the person they call when they need the thinking sharpened or the direction challenged.&lt;br&gt;Anticipate and respond to client questions in a compelling and informed way. Own the client relationship day-to-day, identifying when senior escalation or support is needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify growth opportunities within existing accounts - spot the extension, the adjacent brief, the unasked question and work with senior leadership to convert them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute meaningfully to proposals and pitch responses: shaping the strategic approach, writing key sections, and presenting to prospective clients where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build client relationships that generate repeat work - not just deliver well, but leave clients wanting more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop Consultants on the team: Setting the quality bar on projects, giving direct feedback, and creating opportunities for junior team members to stretch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role may line-manage 1–2 team members, depending on team structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive practice IP development: reusable frameworks, case studies, proposition collateral and points of view that strengthen our market position and make selling easier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across WPP&#39;s integrated network: connecting upstream consulting recommendations to downstream execution in content, CX and commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive professional experience, with a strong track record in consulting, strategy or senior commercial/digital roles (ideally blending both)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how commerce ecosystems work: You&#39;ve either run a commerce operation (brand-side) or advised on one (agency/consulting-side). You understand how trading, content, category management, channel strategy and technology intersect in practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of AI discoverability: GEO, AEO, LLM-influenced discovery, AI assistants and conversational commerce. You can advise a Head of Digital or VP of eCommerce on what this shift means for their business and back it up with a credible action plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead projects independently - you&#39;ve managed scope, quality and client expectations without someone looking over your shoulder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic and analytical thinking: you can take a diagnostic output or a data-heavy assessment and turn it into a clear, commercially prioritised set of recommendations with a compelling narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and executive presence - you&#39;re comfortable leading a room, running a workshop, and navigating a difficult client conversation with credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building methodology or practice IP: You&#39;ve created frameworks, playbooks or delivery approaches that others have adopted and scaled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand-side experience in eCommerce, digital marketing or commercial leadership - you&#39;ve lived the reality of managing a P&amp;amp;L, running a digital operation, or leading a commerce team. This perspective is what separates a genuine consultant from a presenter of slides.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in at least two of: CPG/FMCG, Consumer health, Automotive, Retail, Telecom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change management or enablement experience: you&#39;ve helped organisations adopt new operating models, not just designed them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line management or mentoring experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you know some of this, even better:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on curiosity with AI tools LLMs, agentic platforms, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with commerce technology (Shopify, SFCC, Commercetools, PIM/DAM systems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to shape a growing consulting practice your work will define methodology and propositions, not just execute someone else&#39;s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct access to iconic enterprise clients and the opportunity to contribute to both proposition development and project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An integrated agency network where your consulting work connects to creative, content, CX and commerce teams who make the recommendations real.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team culture that values intellectual honesty, pace and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;London-based with flexible hybrid working and occasional client travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training, development, and a clear path to Senior Consultant and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent only&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a great benefits package including a discretionary bonus scheme, training opportunities, competitive pension, medical insurance, life assurance, social events, opportunities to buy and sell holidays, family friendly policies, discounts with hundreds of retailers and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
